Klimazoner: vahl.json og koppen.json er bearbejdet fra Beck m.fl. (2023).

Kilde: Beck, H. E., McVicar, T. R., Vergopolan, N., Berg, A., Lutsko, N. J.,
Dufour, A., Zeng, Z., Jiang, X., van Dijk, A. I. J. M. og Miralles, D. G.
(2023), High-resolution (1 km) Köppen-Geiger maps for 1901–2099 based on
constrained CMIP6 projections, Scientific Data 10, 724,
doi:10.1038/s41597-023-02549-6.
Data: figshare, doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.21789074 (artikel 21789074),
licens CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Hentet 15. oktober 2026:
  https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/61012822  koppen_geiger_tif.zip
  https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/61012816  climate_data_0p5.zip

